  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medical Relief for patients of CDS Nyakira</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDS Nyakira, a local clinic in Kanyosha, Burundi, serves residents of the commune. It is one of the few clinics in the area that provide leniency in repaying medical debt. Patients are allowed to get treatment and afterward have the option of paying immediate payment options or debt forgiveness. Beauty out of Dust wants to provide medical debt relief to families and individuals who demonstrate financial hardship clear their portions of medical debt to CDS Nyakira.</narrative>
  </description>
